PN,36701
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1785923291
OL,3,CFour men arrested over 'horrendous'
OL,4,Cillegal waste dumping
OL,6,FFour men have been arrested as part of
OL,7,Fan ongoing investigation into
OL,8,F"horrendous" large-scale illegal
OL,9,Fdumping of waste.
OL,11,FThe Environment Agency said residents
OL,12,Fnear the Bolton House Road waste site
OL,13,Fin Wigan reported horrid smells, while
OL,14,Fa week-long fire caused nearby schools
OL,15,Fto shut last summer.
OL,17,FTwo Wigan men, a 41-year-old and a 35-
OL,18,Fyear-old, a 24-year-old from Leeds,
OL,19,Fand a 59-year old from Liverpool have
OL,20,Fbeen arrested for environmental,
OL,21,Ffraud, and money laundering offences.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,368,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1785923291
OL,3,CFour men arrested over 'horrendous'
OL,4,Cillegal waste dumping
OL,6,FThe 24-year-old man has also been
OL,7,Farrested over waste dumping at the
OL,8,FCave's Inn Pits Site near Shawell,
OL,9,FLeicestershire.
OL,11,FThe Government has announced it will
OL,12,Fdirectly fund the clean-up of the
OL,13,FBolton House Road site, whose entrance
OL,14,Fhas been blocked with concrete blocks
OL,15,Fby the local authority to prevent any
OL,16,Fmore additional waste being dumped
OL,17,Fillegally.
OL,19,FWigan Council is looking to recruit a
OL,20,Fspecialist contractor for the clear-up
OL,21,Fof the site.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,368,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1785923291
OL,3,CFour men arrested over 'horrendous'
OL,4,Cillegal waste dumping
OL,6,FOfficers from Greater Manchester,
OL,7,FLancashire, and West Yorkshire Police,
OL,8,Fworking in support of the Environment
OL,9,FAgency, secured the arrests of the
OL,10,Ffour men.
OL,12,FSue Longstone, Director of Operations
OL,13,Ffor the North at the Environment
OL,14,FAgency said: "The illegal dumping at
OL,15,FBolton House Road and Cave's Inn Pits
OL,16,Fare atrocious attacks on our
OL,17,Fcommunities, and we share the public's
OL,18,Futter disgust at these horrendous
OL,19,Fcrimes.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,368,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1785923291
OL,3,CFour men arrested over 'horrendous'
OL,4,Cillegal waste dumping
OL,6,F"Our teams have been working
OL,7,Frelentlessly on these investigations,
OL,8,Fand our arrests are a vital step in
OL,9,Fcollecting new evidence and
OL,10,Fprogressing it further."
OL,12,FFollowing the arrests, Prime Minister
OL,13,FAndy Burnham said: "I have stood on
OL,14,FBolton House Road and seen what local
OL,15,Fpeople have had to live with. It is
OL,16,Fshocking - an ocean of rubbish piled
OL,17,Fup next to a primary school, and
OL,18,Ffamilies unable to escape the smell in
OL,19,Ftheir own homes.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,368,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1785923291
OL,3,CFour men arrested over 'horrendous'
OL,4,Cillegal waste dumping
OL,6,F"This is not fly tipping. This is
OL,7,Forganised crime, and it is local
OL,8,Fcommunities that are paying the price.
OL,10,F"For too long, this issue has been
OL,11,Fignored. But not on my watch. Today's
OL,12,Faction by the Environment Agency and
OL,13,Fthe police is just the start of our
OL,14,Fplans. The days of making easy money
OL,15,Ffrom waste are over."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,368,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1785923291
OL,3,CFour men arrested over 'horrendous'
OL,4,Cillegal waste dumping
OL,6,FEnvironment Secretary Dame Angela
OL,7,FEagle said: "The appalling dumping of
OL,8,Fwaste at Bolton House Road and Cave's
OL,9,FInn Pits represents a blatant
OL,10,Fdisregard for local communities and
OL,11,Fthe environment.
OL,13,F"Tackling waste crime is one of my top
OL,14,Fpriorities, and these arrests mark an
OL,15,Fimportant step in delivering justice
OL,16,Ffor residents in Wigan and Shawell.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,368,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1785923291
OL,3,CFour men arrested over 'horrendous'
OL,4,Cillegal waste dumping
OL,6,F"This government is taking a zero-
OL,7,Ftolerance approach to waste crime.
OL,8,FThrough our Waste Crime Action Plan,
OL,9,Fwe are giving regulators and
OL,10,Fenforcement agencies the powers and
OL,11,Fresources they need to break up
OL,12,Fcriminal operations and ensure those
OL,13,Fresponsible are held fully accountable
OL,14,Ffor the damage they have caused.
OL,16,F"I want to be clear to waste
OL,17,Fcriminals: we are coming for you."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
